meta {
  name: getGroupedProducts
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getGroupedProducts",
    "params": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 3
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve products grouped under a product group

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |
  | `grouped_product_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by grouped product IDs |
  | `virtual_product_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by virtual product IDs attached to grouped products |
  | `product_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by product IDs that are members of a grouped product |
  | `include_products` | boolean | no | Include the individual products within each grouped product |
  | `include_categories` | boolean | no | Include categories bound to the grouped product |
  | `include_etim_features` | boolean | no | Include ETIM features bound to the grouped product |
  | `include_custom_features` | boolean | no | Include custom features bound to the grouped product |

  **Example: First page of grouped products**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getGroupedProducts",
    "params": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 3
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "grouped_products": [
      {
        "grouped_product_id": 1,
        "grouped_product_code": "GRP001",
        "virtual_product_id": null
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 1,
      "items_per_page": 3,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
